[I] Qt implementation of freedesktop.org xdg specifications

[T] qtxdg-tools contains qtxdg-mat, a command-line MIME tool based on
[T] libqtxdg for handling file associations and opening files with their
[T] default applications. LXQt Session needs it for use by xdg-utils.

[U] https://github.com/lxqt/qtxdg-tools

[A] Libqtxdg Authors
